---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Service Areas
lead: We serve homeowners across Central Florida — from the heart of Orlando to the surrounding suburbs and communities.
eyebrow: Where We Work
permalink: /service-areas/
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Cities We Serve</span>
      <h2>Central Florida Service Area</h2>
      <p>Not sure if we cover your neighborhood? Call us — if we can get there, we will.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="area-card-grid">
      {% for city in areas.list %}
      <div class="area-card">{{ city }}</div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="callout">
      <h3>Don't see your city?</h3>
      <p>Give us a call and we'll let you know if we can make it out. We try to say yes.</p>
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="btn btn--orange btn--lg">Call {{ site.phone }}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
